{{Skill infobox|id=Barkskin}}

'''Barkskin''' is a [[skill]] granted by the {{psl|Mother's Teachings}} Notable ascendancy passive for the [[Warden]]. It grants stacks of Bark, with each stack granting a flat reduction to [[physical damage]] taken from [[attack]]s. When hit by an attack, a stack of Bark is removed, granting more [[evasion]] chance based on stacks of missing Bark. Bark generates over time after not being hit.

==Skill progression==
Only the level 20 version is being used in-game.

{{Skill progression
|id                   = Barkskin
|c1_abbr              = - Physical Damage taken
  |c1_header          = -x Physical Damage taken from Attack Hits per Bark
  |c1_pattern_extract = -(%d+) Physical Damage taken from Attack Hits per Bark
  |c1_pattern_value   = -%d
|c2_abbr              = Chance to Evade Attacks
  |c2_header          = x% more chance to Evade Attacks per Bark below maximum
  |c2_pattern_extract = (%d+)%% more chance to Evade Attacks per Bark below maximum
  |c2_pattern_value   = %d%%
}}

==Mechanics==
Barkskin works like a [[reservation]] skill, but reserves no resources.

